  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Felyne Parting Gift</strong> <em>(Daily Skill)</em></p><p>The first time an ally drops to 0 hit points during a hunt, they can choose up to 6 creatures in a 30-foot radius of them. Those creatures are healed for [[/r 2d6]] hit points.</p><p><em>Artisan Cooking Daily Skill. Gained when a meal succeeds by 4+ (roll once) or by 8+ (roll twice). Apply to hunters who ate the meal; duration is typically until the end of the hunt or 24 hours (DM&apos;s call), unless noted otherwise.</em></p>",
      "chat": "<p><strong>Felyne Parting Gift</strong></p><p>First ally to 0 HP: heal up to 6 creatures in 30 ft for 2d6.</p>"
    },
